      "writtenOn": "2026-04-15T09:26:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "FetchPromisesCache is used under the hood by fetchCacheJSON in GrRestApiHelper. However, fetchCacheJSON only forms its cache key from the URL and query parameters. Since getFixPreview utilizes an HTTP POST method with a specific JSON payload in the body containing the fix replacements (fixReplacementInfos), fetchCacheJSON would mistakenly consider requests targeting the same URL but containing completely different replacement bodies as identical. That yields incorrect, overlapping cache hits. Therefore, we implemented a custom distinct fixPreviewCache Map directly in getFixPreview whose cache keys are safely generated by aggregating the stringified replacement payload itself to maintain unique correctness across all different suggested fixes.",
      "parentUuid": "adec233c_317e4bd2",
